{"type":"message","id":"eff34f36","parentId":"0f352497","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:24:40.207Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_yH5EVyn7hLTxJMjlg0ybc6ic","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Session: 2026-03-27 01:24:25 UTC\n\n- **Session Key**: agent:rewrite-article:feishu:group:oc_afb178c01156b8cff4692ddbef6bbc97\n- **Session ID**: 33278772-6d30-4e33-86ed-aeb143ac3cfa\n- **Source**: feishu\n\n## Conversation Summary\n\nassistant: ✅ New session started · model: xiguacity/gpt-5.2\nuser: System: [2026-03-25 14:05:18 GMT+8] Feishu[default] message in group oc_afb178c01156b8cff4692ddbef6bbc97: /reset\n\nA new session was started via /new or /reset. Execute your Session Startup sequence now - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nassistant: [[reply_to_current]] 我在。把“标题 + 提纲”发我（按飞书格式也行），我就用内容库检索素材并生成一篇完整文章；你今天想写什么主题？\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774574680200}}
